      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for generating a presigned download URL, I will use the AWS S3 service as the concrete external provider. This will involve importing the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and using it to create a presigned URL for an S3 object. The provider will be identifiable through the import of boto3 and the use of AWS-specific methods and parameters. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
