        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that uploads a file or byte stream to a managed object storage service. I will use Amazon S3 as the concrete external provider for this task. The script will include the necessary imports and authentication details to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
